Wednesday Update
* Trade Alert: Sold half XPEV calls for 32% gain* Stocks advance sharply am=
id optimism for Biden inaugurationStocks are ripping higher Wednesday morni=
ng as Joe Biden began his four-year term as president, which is expected to=
 start with aggressive stimulus policies to propel a strong recovery from t=
he COVID-19 pandemic and overcome political volatility.Hope for stimulus co=
mes as Biden's nominee for Treasury secretary, Janet Yellen, said during a =
Tuesday confirmation hearing in the Senate that "a failure to use fiscal po=
licy aggressively now to address the crisis would likely result in a worse =
fiscal outlook over the long term.=E2=80=9DLockdowns and other restrictive =
measures to contain the pandemic that started last March have depressed lar=
ge areas of the economy, such as air travel and restaurants, leading to ris=
es in unemployment and a contraction in the economy last year.The Nasdaq ou=
tperformed the measures, as Netflix (NFLX) surged 13% after it reported tha=
t record growth in 2020 helped the streaming service surpass the 200 millio=
n subscribers mark.Technology companies powered ahead, with Microsoft (MSFT=
) up 3% and Salesforce.com (CRM) gaining 2.8%. Goldman Sachs (GS) slipped 1=
.6% as financials fell 0.6% on the Standard &amp; Poor's 500. But the overa=
ll tone on the S&amp;P 500 was upbeat, with communication services posting =
the biggest increase with a 2.5% gain, followed by information technology, =
which was up 1.5%.In company news, Alibaba (BABA) jumped 5.9% after several=
 media reports that founder Jack Ma made a public appearance. He had not ap=
peared in public since Oct. 24, when he slammed China's regulatory system i=
n a speech, according to the reports.Portfolio: Our new Xpeng calls hit the=
ir first target for a 32% gain; adjust second target and stop. LYV order di=
d not fill. We have two new ideas for you.*CURRENT RECOMMENDATIONXpeng Inc.=
 (XPEV) February $60 calls-- Symbol: XPEV210219C00060000-- Bought at $4.60 =
on Jan. 19-- Sold half at $6.10 for 32% gain!-- Now trading at $4.20-- Set =
up to sell second half at new $7.50-- Lift stop to new $3.60*NEW RECOMMENDA=
TIONSTeledoc Inc. (TDOC) February $280 calls-- Symbol: TDOC210219C00280000-=
- Order: Buy at $4.50 lmt day only-- If filled, set up to sell half at $5.9=
0 lmt gtc and half at $7.60 lmt gtc-- If filled, set stop at $3.15 stp, goo=
d after 10:30 a.m. ET only&nbsp;*Datadog Inc. (DDOG) February $110 calls-- =
Symbol: DDOG210219C0011000-- Order: Buy at $5.90 lmt day only-- If filled, =
set up to sell half at $7.70 lmt gtc and half at $10.00 lmt gtc-- If filled=
, set stop at $4.10 stp, good after 10:30 a.m. ET only&nbsp;*Jon D. Markman=
